WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_06h.avi - Squall catches Rinoa
Duration: approximately 7 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Their hands finally clasp together, gloved fingers interlocking. Squall pulls Rinoa toward him with strength and urgency. Her limp body comes to him, and he wraps his arms around her, holding her close against his suited body. In the weightlessness of space, they float together, locked in an embrace of desperation and relief. Behind his helmet visor, Squall's expression shows a mix of determination, concern, and emotional release. His eyes are visible, conveying the depth of his commitment to saving her. He holds Rinoa protectively, securing her against him as if to anchor her to life itself. The moment is intimate despite the hostile environment, a human connection in the void.
